	(text_box "CAUTION: say the target has VCC at 1V8 and TARGET_VCC connected directly. We will pull the 1V8 rail up to 3V3 which can damage the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 15.24 0)
		(size 73.66 11.43)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 255 0 43 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 255 0 20 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "52fe1105-ca6d-4dbc-a749-6886be364ad5")
	)
	(text_box "1. When the target is unpowered, we provided 3V3.\n2. If the target is already powered, say at 3V7, the MAX40203 ideal diode will block reverse current reaching the XIAO.\n3. If the probe is plugged in backwards (or TARGET_VCC touches GND), the polyfuse will trip in milliseconds. This protects the XIAO and ideal diode\n4. The resistors on SWDCLK and SWDIO help with ESD protection and signal integrity."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 30.48 0)
		(size 73.66 20.32)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f27b1de9-39d3-46d2-9453-3c345561bfe2")
	)
